{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FastShoot is a true chess game in the world of first-person shooters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy your enemies in the most unbelievable and spectacular ways - shoot, blow up, throw them over cliffs, throw them under deadly blows and use your abilities and surroundings wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498960/extras/Desc1.png?t=1744657156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncomplicated mechanics, familiar to every shooter fan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498960/extras/Desc2.png?t=1744657156\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of different opponents, requiring unique strategies and using special techniques for mass and spectacular destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498960/extras/Desc3.png?t=1744657156\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and interesting maps with parkour, shootouts or both elements at once!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498960/extras/Desc3__1_.png?t=1744657156\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First victory!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498960/30e62b49c8dad70b3a0284f3d569487ff3abce0b.jpg"},{"name":"Too Fast?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498960/73090cc52cd3c5cb8284fb6dd3dfcef724baee8f.jpg"},{"name":"DisHeaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498960/42fc11d4ff0fe5c551a9f4094c5907598bacc02a.jpg"},{"name":"KaBoom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im